emoved","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:f665e238fcbc4a7adc9d41faa74cbd2cfce9844c52c042ce27149d186ff7eabc","file":"preprints/An-unconditional-first-moment-for-cubic-Gauss-sums-September-25-2026/build/paper.tex","line":64,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"d9c159ba6995552b722e9e9c2d757aaf72c48cbac9eb4caa80417c8d9622250e","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/An-unconditional-first-moment-for-cubic-Gauss-sums-September-25-2026/build/paper.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:f665e238fcbc4a7adc9d41faa74cbd2cfce9844c52c042ce27149d186ff7eabc","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/An-unconditional-first-moment-for-cubic-Gauss-sums-September-25-2026/build/paper.tex#L64"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nAs $X\\longrightarrow\\infty$,\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:main}\n \\sum_{\\substack{N\\pi\\le X\\\\\\pi\\equiv1\\pmod3\\ \\mathrm{prime}}}G(\\pi)\n =\\frac65c_*\\frac{X^{5/6}}{\\log X}\n   +o\\!\\left(\\frac{X^{5/6}}{\\log X}\\right).\n\\end{equation}\nThe sum is over all primary primes in $\\mathcal O$."}
